WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:06.420
What's up guys!

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:07.340
We are Pongfinity.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:10.920
We have tried giant ping pong, but today we will do mini ping pong.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:12.960
Let's start with half a table.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.220
This looks really weird.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:22.140
Sorry!

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:37.180
What was that?

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.080
It wasn't on the table.

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:01.400
I could have easily made it...

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:29.680
I actually got it in!

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:51.420
Now we have an even smaller table.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:01.240
Chop block.

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:26.720
Was it around the net?

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:27.720
Yes.

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:31.560
That was around the net.

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:57.860
Okay, we are taking this one step further with a mini racket and mini ball.

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:08.340
That was the world's smallest around the net.

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:11.080
Perhaps!

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:12.320
Let's see.

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:13.120
Zero - zero.

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:42.980
Yes! I got one point!

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:44.460
I gave him the one point.

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:45.720
Thank you!

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.240
I'm coming back!

00:03:56.740 --> 00:03:57.740
Net serve.

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:01.100
I'll put some underspin.

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:26.460
So lucky!

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:27.360
Easy!

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:28.880
Good match!

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:30.940
The fastest table tennis set ever.

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:33.300
Thanks for watching guys! Hope you enjoyed this episode.

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:34.660
Remember to subscribe here

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:36.280
And check out our previous videos there.

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:37.400
Until next time!

